{"id":"22c421a655624500","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-comb6-hypergraph.md","title":"ZFC Comb6 Hypergraph","display":"df-zfc-comb6-hypergraph — ZFC Comb6 Hypergraph","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb6-hypergraph","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb6-hypergraph"],"display":"df-zfc-comb6-hypergraph — ZFC Comb6 Hypergraph","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-pair.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb6-hypergraph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb6-hypergraph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb6-hypergraph — ZFC Comb6 Hypergraph"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f16f4ca5b9c48bbe\" href=\"?note=f16f4ca5b9c48bbe\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-pair.md\">../batch12/58-df-pair.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,V,E\\in V\">\\(H,V,E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle:V^2\\to V\">\\(\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle:V^2\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f16f4ca5b9c48bbe\" href=\"?note=f16f4ca5b9c48bbe\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-pair.md\">../batch12/58-df-pair.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathcal P:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb6Hypergraph}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb6Hypergraph}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}hypergraph} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb6Hypergraph}_S(H,V,E)\\leftrightarrow\nH=\\langle V,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(V)\\land\\varnothing\\notin E\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb6\\text{-}hypergraph} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb6Hypergraph}_S(H,V,E)\\leftrightarrow\nH=\\langle V,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(V)\\land\\varnothing\\notin E\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus every hyperedge is a nonempty subset of the declared vertex set; the edge family itself may be empty.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-pair.md","status":"resolved","id":"f16f4ca5b9c48bbe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-pair.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-pair.md","status":"resolved","id":"f16f4ca5b9c48bbe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle:V^2\\to V$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-pair.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b